          "text": "Since Dinv B_t(f,F)=S_(-t)P[(S_t f)(S_t F)], split f=w+(f-w). N006 bounds the w product by C_gamma||w||_(H^gamma)||F||_(H^(a_gamma))<=C_(gamma,M0)*q using F001. For the other product use ||f-w||_2||S_t F||_infinity<=C_(gamma,M0)*delta by the uniform H^1 stage bound and N005. Thus sup||Dinv B_t(f,F)||_2<=C_(gamma,M0)*q. Differentiating the definition Y=Cst+Q-((t-a)/tau)W gives Y'=B_t(f,F)+(1/2)B_t(F,F)-W/tau. N005, F002 and this asymmetric product estimate give sup||Dinv Y'||_2<=C_(gamma,M0)*q. As Y(a)=0, integration gives sup||Dinv Y||_2<=C_(gamma,M0)*tau*q.",
